1
00:00:01,333 --> 00:00:03,458
My lord, why…?

2
00:00:07,291 --> 00:00:10,750
Yes, I obey.

3
00:00:14,791 --> 00:00:15,875
My lord, what’s wrong?

4
00:00:15,875 --> 00:00:19,000
The Sovereign Sanctum’s honored envoy has ordered…

5
00:00:19,750 --> 00:00:24,250
all support for the
Scott family is terminated!

6
00:00:24,875 --> 00:00:26,416
Terminated!

7
00:00:26,416 --> 00:00:27,625
What?!

8
00:00:27,625 --> 00:00:28,833
What?!

9
00:00:29,083 --> 00:00:30,291
Because of him?

10
00:00:30,291 --> 00:00:31,541
No way!

11
00:00:31,541 --> 00:00:33,375
A disowned failure,

12
00:00:33,375 --> 00:00:36,416
how could he possibly be the great Godfather?

13
00:00:36,875 --> 00:00:38,083
Exactly!

14
00:00:38,541 --> 00:00:41,500
This coward has been weak and useless since he was a child.

15
00:00:42,583 --> 00:00:44,208
He’s an idiot!

16
00:00:44,208 --> 00:00:45,000
Ridiculous!

17
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:46,750
I know my own son best.

18
00:00:47,250 --> 00:00:48,291
If he were the Godfather,

19
00:00:48,291 --> 00:00:50,166
House Carter would already
be one of the

20
00:00:50,166 --> 00:00:52,791
greatest families. We wouldn't be stuck here!

21
00:00:52,791 --> 00:00:55,458
You all treated me like garbage,

22
00:00:55,791 --> 00:00:57,375
and I also
saw the Carter family

23
00:00:57,375 --> 00:00:59,750
as insignificant and
didn’t bother supporting you.

24
00:01:00,666 --> 00:01:02,791
That’s why you have no future.

25
00:01:03,625 --> 00:01:07,250
Steward Jeyn, don’t fall
for this loser’s tricks!

26
00:01:07,250 --> 00:01:10,250
But… the highest decree from
the Sovereign Sanctum 

27
00:01:10,250 --> 00:01:11,333
canceling the contract…

28
00:01:11,333 --> 00:01:12,333
that can’t be faked!

29
00:01:12,333 --> 00:01:13,708
I get it now!

30
00:01:13,708 --> 00:01:15,541
This loser must
have stolen the Godfather’s

31
00:01:15,541 --> 00:01:17,375
communication stone and faked the decree!

32
00:01:17,833 --> 00:01:19,041
Exactly!

33
00:01:19,041 --> 00:01:20,791
The Godfather appears and disappears

34
00:01:20,791 --> 00:01:21,958
like a dragon in the clouds.

35
00:01:21,958 --> 00:01:23,583
The Sovereign Sanctum only recognizes 

36
00:01:23,583 --> 00:01:25,416
 crystal decrees, not people!

37
00:01:25,416 --> 00:01:27,041
So we overestimated you.

38
00:01:27,041 --> 00:01:29,333
You’re just a thief
who stole a divine artifact.

39
00:01:29,333 --> 00:01:32,500
Admit it. You stole the communication stone!

40
00:01:34,291 --> 00:01:37,500
My lord, allow me
to slaughter these fools.

41
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,250
No need.

42
00:01:40,250 --> 00:01:44,625
Jeyn, it seems I'll have to issue another decree, stripping

43
00:01:44,625 --> 00:01:46,750
you of your steward
position and sending you to

44
00:01:46,750 --> 00:01:49,875
the Sovereign Sanctum’s black prison for judgment.

45
00:01:54,750 --> 00:01:57,125
Stop trying to deceive me!

46
00:01:57,125 --> 00:02:01,583
I’ll drag you back to
the Sovereign Sanctum myself for punishment!

47
00:02:01,583 --> 00:02:04,916
Livia, summon the City Guard Captain immediately!

48
00:02:05,375 --> 00:02:07,208
Severin, last chance.

49
00:02:07,208 --> 00:02:09,500
Kneel and accept your death,

50
00:02:09,500 --> 00:02:12,083
or wait for the
guards to drag you away.

51
00:02:12,083 --> 00:02:13,291
Whatever.

52
00:02:13,291 --> 00:02:14,541
I’ll wait.

53
00:02:15,208 --> 00:02:16,708
Severin, did you really steal it?

54
00:02:16,708 --> 00:02:19,125
Mother, I've had it for years.

55
00:02:19,208 --> 00:02:22,708
Still lying even when
you’re about to die.

56
00:02:23,166 --> 00:02:26,000
The family already cast
you out long ago.

57
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:30,500
Even if the Sovereign Sanctum punishes you, it won’t touch us.

58
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:32,125
City Guard Captain?

59
00:02:32,125 --> 00:02:35,541
Someone in the Holy Cathedral is impersonating the Godfather 

60
00:02:35,541 --> 00:02:38,333
and forging decrees from the Sovereign Sanctum.

61
00:02:38,333 --> 00:02:39,958
Send troops immediately!

62
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:44,125
I was willing to overlook it
for the sake of shared blood.

63
00:02:44,666 --> 00:02:47,416
But since you
insist on seeking death,

64
00:02:47,958 --> 00:02:50,416
I’ll give you a proper lesson.

65
00:02:50,416 --> 00:02:52,875
Hahahaaa

66
00:02:52,916 --> 00:02:54,916
Teach me a lesson?

67
00:02:54,916 --> 00:02:57,291
With what? Your worthless words?

68
00:02:57,291 --> 00:03:00,000
By my command, within fifteen minutes,

69
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:02,125
House Carter is
to be completely removed

70
00:03:02,125 --> 00:03:04,875
from the noble circles of Emeraldstone.

71
00:03:07,791 --> 00:03:12,250
Say goodbye to the
family you’re so proud of.

72
00:03:12,250 --> 00:03:14,916
Hah, what a performance!

73
00:03:14,916 --> 00:03:19,875
I’ll sit right here and watch you try to destroy House Carter!
